cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (Zenodo DOI) and the accompanying paper."
title: "WCF Biofilm Adsorption: molecular-dynamics-informed and physics-informed modelling of reactive dye adsorption on a waste-cotton PVA/TiO2/cellulose biofilm"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying a study of Avitera Light Red SE adsorption on a
  waste-cotton derived PVA/TiO2/cellulose biofilm, combining wet-lab
  characterisation, classical kinetics and isotherm fitting, all-atom molecular
  dynamics, and a physics-informed neural network.
type: software
license: MIT
